  "_about": [
    "The export contract of the toawowchar addon, as wowchar owns it. Do not change a value here on its own:",
    "toaweb/toawowchar owns these values (app/shared/addon-sections.ts, app/shared/addon-export-format.ts,",
    "app/server/utils/addon-export.ts, app/server/utils/request-body.ts, app/shared/quest-keys.ts). This is a copy, so the",
    "addon's tests can run without the wowchar app. A change to a number here goes as two pull requests, one per",
    "repository, and the web-app session is told first (see AGENTS.md). wowchar tests its real decoder against",
    "this repository's example exports (dist/examples/), which is the check that the two sides agree."
